            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tampilkan <code>Welcome, Silvia</code> di konsol dengan menambahkan <code>\" Silvia\"</code> ke nilai variabel <code>welcome</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" welcome = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Welcome,&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"welcome += \" /><text value=\"&quot; Silvia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(welcome);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"--\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Welcome, Silvia\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>welcome</code>, diikuti oleh <code>+=</code>, dan terakhir <code>\" Silvia\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
