            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lewati blok kode while loop dengan mengatur kondisinya ke <code>false</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Let's go!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Repeat after me:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;I love to code!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;That's all!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"30\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Let's go!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"That's all!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Creating the variable",
            "id": 126900,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk menjalankan loop, tetapkan <code>true</code> ke <code>isLooping</code> di luar blok kode.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isLooping = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isLooping {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;and again!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" isLooping = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"20\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"and again!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Updating the variable",
            "id": 126901,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana kita tahu bahwa loop ini tidak berhenti?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" keepGoing = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" keepGoing {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;We will rock you!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" keepGoing = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"We will rock you!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"We will rock you!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"We will rock you!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Looks like your code runs forever. It may be that an infinite loop exists in your code.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Karena variabel <code>keepGoing</code> tidak diperbarui menjadi <code>false</code> di dalam blok kode</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Karena semua loop <code>while</code> tidak berhenti</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Karena variabel <code>keepGoing</code> diperbarui menjadi <code>false</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Karena variabel <code>keepGoing</code> tidak diperbarui menjadi <code>false</code> di dalam blok kode.</p></body></html>"
